			description: ["[ \"The Terrestrial Agglomeration Plate is a multiblock, what items are needed to make it and how to build it is shown in your Botania manual. It is a very mana hungry machine, so I recommend feeding it with \", { \"text\": \"Sparks\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"1C9C003BA0778900\" } }, \" instead of Mana Spreaders. \" ] To craft with it you drop the items on the plate and wait for the big blobs to stop moving. The item will then fly out. Be aware if it takes to long to craft the items you craft with will despawn in this machine so keep an eye on it and make sure it has a lot of mana available. \" ]"]
			hide_dependent_lines: true
